This repository contains the implementation of **PCG-CD**, proposed in our ECML-PKDD submission:
> MDL Meets Latent Confounders: LNML-based Causal Discovery

The code supports multivariate causal graph discovery with latent confounders under nonlinear mechanisms using an LNML-based criterion.

---

## Requirements

- Python >= 3.8
- numpy
- pandas
- scipy
- scikit-learn


## File Structure
.
├── data/               # Datasets
│   ├──real		# Real-world dataset
│   ├──art		# Artificial datasets
├── alg.py		# Script to run artificial datasets
├── alg_real.py		# Script to run real-world dataset (Auto MPG)
├── eval.py		# Performance metrics
└── README.md


## How to Run

- Artificial Experiments

    python3 alg.py
    python3 eval.py

- Real-world Experiments

    python3 alg_real.py

The scripts will output inferred causal graphs and corresponding $\Delta$ values (for real-world data only).
Results will be written in the result/ directory in the corresponding data files after running the experiments.



